#X text 240 83 the object stores incoming messages in a LIFO stack:
the last pushed message is the first to be popped;
#X text 240 123 messages on the left inlet are pushed onto the stack
\, a bang on the right inlet outputs and removes the top element;
#X text 240 178 the selectors [top( \, [pop( \, [clear( and [flush(
allow to peek \, remove \, clear or drain the stack;
#X text 240 218 @max_size limits the stack size \, @on_empty and @on_full
send a message when the stack becomes empty or full;
